00:25:11.860 --> 00:25:14.220
and their input goes a long
way because we are still

00:25:14.220 --> 00:25:15.803
making a lot of
decisions on how we're

00:25:15.803 --> 00:25:19.074
going to move forward with these
runtimes and all this stuff.

00:25:19.074 --> 00:25:19.990
